          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA ghwahidu heeda Yeremiya aba nyoota roopta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA: “Adiidu gimooriisi fiisu gea miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gooluulda geat, ea maydealeeysa iita shooka nyaawa, eara gagu haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida, ea gea booga, ea maydaang'waay; hean gaydahuuyda saawa aba ng'uta, ea geejeeda, ea aba dawni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geayeeshi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, ashoohoodiga gwayeesha saawa, ‘Agooga mwajadaaha ng'uta ea geejeeda, gaydagooneegwa hoyyooyda huumwa aba hiji.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA: “Sibanga gwarukwiida ng'asheega ng'uyeega aba gheawungeasu; Aniini miideajeakta saawa, ghana darukusa gil, ghana deabalool. Inyeesa ghwaramoar giirgweatka ng'uyeega aba heedeang'wa, ea giirgweatka marachi gil, nea inyeesa gang'asa geat ng'uyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda sibanga ramoorani aba gheawungeasu nea meajeaktani nea gwayeena, ‘Ng'uta ea geejeeda mayghoani badayda ng'eanyiida’: Nea sibang'su gajeehuuyda aba ng'uta ea geejeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga ramoorasa gajeejaksa jarooda jeeda naweadinga Yerusalemu, was gea nihuuyda geejeeda ea ng'uta, nea manda siichea gabuy saawa, ea gadeemga nyaawa, ea orjooga nyaawa ea haweega nyaawa. Aba gideaba gaydahisa munyasnacheeka nyaawa badahuuka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buuneeda gamearmearani NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
